1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,568
Meanwhile, the real bottleneck is not model quality.

2
00:00:03,568 --> 00:00:04,818
It is ownership.

3
00:00:04,818 --> 00:00:07,826
Four competent agents, one shared repository,

4
00:00:07,826 --> 00:00:10,902
and no shared model of what anyone is actually

5
00:00:10,902 --> 00:00:11,771
trying to do.

6
00:00:11,771 --> 00:00:13,216
Context collapse.

7
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:14,596
Conflicting edits.

8
00:00:14,596 --> 00:00:15,755
Spaghetti code.

9
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:17,747
Competence does not compose.
